window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A spicy, Fae </b><b><i>Sleeping Beauty</i></b><b> retelling with a male version of Maleficent, a dying realm, and intriguing twists on the old tale.</b></p> <p>When Malec, the Void King, attacks Princess Dawn's carriage, her Fae bodyguard Aura switches places with her. Glamoured as a human, Aura must fool Malec into thinking she's the Princess he cursed twenty-five years ago. Relentless and powerful, but with a vulnerable side he hides from others, Malec begins to crave Aura's respect as much as he craves her body.</p> <p>Contains mature themes. Trigger and content warnings are available on the author's website.</p>"; 
